{"id":"bien","lemma":"bien","pos":"adv","rank":26,"glosses":["well (adverbial form of bueno)","well; fine; okay (state of being satisfied with the status quo)","properly"],"ipa":"/ˈbjen/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-bien.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Está bien el lunes?","en":"Is Monday OK?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302899"},{"text":"Bien, inténtalo otra vez.","en":"OK, try again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850176"},{"text":"Te ves muy bien.","en":"You look fine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443234"},{"text":"No está bien mentir.","en":"Lying is wrong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550078"},{"text":"Supongo que está bien.","en":"I guess it's OK.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441573"}]}